WEBVTT

00:01:57.130 --> 00:01:58.720
The same person?

00:02:08.410 --> 00:02:10.240
At long last we meet...

00:02:15.450 --> 00:02:16.780
...Enkidu.

00:02:21.450 --> 00:02:24.010
No, Terumichi Madoka.

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:38.430
Dr. Kageyama, it's been a long time.

00:02:39.100 --> 00:02:41.270
The three of you all look well.

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:43.370
You haven't changed either.

00:02:44.080 --> 00:02:49.200
I regret that though you've gone to the effort of gathering here, I can't even set out tea.

00:02:49.780 --> 00:02:51.320
Think nothing of it.

00:02:51.320 --> 00:02:56.250
We've only come here in order to bring down the curtain.

00:02:56.960 --> 00:03:00.220
You're right. Let's bring this all to an end.

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:05.990
It's an odd feeling, meeting face-to-face with yourself like this.

00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:08.600
That's the truth. It's a sickening feeling.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:14.370
Even so, I'm astonished that all of you survived too.

00:03:14.940 --> 00:03:16.270
It's because of Tear.

00:03:16.270 --> 00:03:17.440
Huh?

00:03:17.440 --> 00:03:20.710
The one who kept us alive was Tear.

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:28.250
Guarding and restoring the cells of our bodies, which were on the verge of fading away, was the will of Tear.

00:03:28.620 --> 00:03:29.950
Why did Tear...

00:03:30.960 --> 00:03:32.620
Dr. Madoka, tell me.

00:03:33.530 --> 00:03:38.090
The one who first made the world aware of the danger of Delphys was you.

00:03:38.560 --> 00:03:40.330
Why would such a man as you...

00:03:46.640 --> 00:03:47.610
What?!

00:03:50.910 --> 00:03:52.470
In order to start it all over again.

00:03:53.810 --> 00:03:55.040
Evolution, that is.

00:04:12.830 --> 00:04:16.460
Might you be saying that the evolution of homo sapiens was a mistake?

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:21.400
As a life form, humankind has broken down.

00:04:21.810 --> 00:04:24.070
You children understand that, don't you?

00:04:24.640 --> 00:04:28.010
What did the adults around you do to you?

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:33.750
We know about you, and about your histories.

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:37.550
And also about your wounded hearts.

00:04:38.290 --> 00:04:40.850
Would any other living creature do such things?

00:04:41.790 --> 00:04:47.260
Seen from the perspective of the cosmic laws, humanity itself is a hazardous contaminant.

00:04:47.700 --> 00:04:50.500
That's your own fault, isn't it, Dad?!

00:04:50.670 --> 00:04:53.690
We also know about all of you.

00:04:55.170 --> 00:04:59.540
Shouichi Kidokoro, you were brought up well-loved by your family.

00:05:00.350 --> 00:05:03.110
In all the pictures from your childhood, you were smiling.

00:05:05.080 --> 00:05:07.850
Dr. Kagami and Dr. Mayuzumi too...

00:05:09.320 --> 00:05:12.150
Even we haven't felt continually hurt our whole lives.

00:05:12.890 --> 00:05:15.830
After meeting Isamu, and Fu and Tatsuya,

00:05:16.030 --> 00:05:21.400
...I learned to feel that I wanted to be with somebody.

00:05:22.100 --> 00:05:24.470
That is what brings ruin to the world.

00:05:24.570 --> 00:05:25.470
Huh?

00:05:25.700 --> 00:05:30.160
Human nature is cowardly, mean and arrogant.

00:05:30.940 --> 00:05:35.140
Even the emotions you describe are no more than cliquish ego.

00:05:35.610 --> 00:05:36.810
But...

00:05:37.120 --> 00:05:44.480
Human beings aren't able to free themselves from such emotions, sad though it is.

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:51.800
Tatsuya, human beings, you see, have always been like this, since before the sky became a mirror.

00:05:51.800 --> 00:05:53.020
That's not...

00:05:53.530 --> 00:06:00.660
Who was it that injected a vast amount of capital to interfere in the affairs of Delphys, which Dr. Madoka discovered?

00:06:01.270 --> 00:06:06.710
It was neither Gilgamesh nor Enkidu who sought eternal life.

00:06:07.880 --> 00:06:10.540
It was an old man enslaved to his own obsessions.

00:06:10.980 --> 00:06:14.110
He himself is the very symbol of ugly humanity.

00:06:15.720 --> 00:06:18.520
The Gilgamesh, who have both divine and human blood,

00:06:18.990 --> 00:06:22.590
...should have been one form of the evolution to which humans must aspire.

00:06:23.190 --> 00:06:31.230
But they too are destined to go down to ruin, because of the imperfection of human genes.

00:06:31.800 --> 00:06:35.200
So in order to give birth to a more proper humankind,

00:06:35.710 --> 00:06:39.670
...it is necessary to cleanse the world once of the entire human race of now.

00:06:40.650 --> 00:06:42.480
I've grown tired of listening to talk on this subject.

00:06:44.550 --> 00:06:47.780
I don't care whether humans are arrogant or not.

00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:54.020
I only want to meet the Terumichi Madoka I know one more time.

00:06:54.660 --> 00:07:01.420
The you I know loved music, trusted people and was always looking to the future.

00:07:02.300 --> 00:07:03.670
Why did that man...

00:07:59.120 --> 00:08:03.150
It's a specific wave, tuned to your genetic makeup.

00:08:14.870 --> 00:08:15.960
Damn!

00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:20.570
Madoka!

00:08:22.550 --> 00:08:23.980
I'm all right.

00:08:24.280 --> 00:08:25.440
Professor!

00:08:45.200 --> 00:08:47.230
That's... Tear!

00:08:49.310 --> 00:08:52.940
So Tear was inside Enkidu, as I thought.

00:08:57.480 --> 00:09:05.550
The reason Terumichi Madoka, who was naturally gentle and could never do anything like killing people, became a terrorist...

00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:08.620
It was because of that creature.

00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:19.140
Is that...

00:09:19.140 --> 00:09:20.300
It's Little Hiroko!

00:09:45.730 --> 00:09:48.360
Tear... is my heart...

00:09:49.230 --> 00:09:54.730
So this is what "Delphys is linked to human hearts" meant.

00:09:56.510 --> 00:09:59.670
That cavern is like a sort of womb.

00:10:06.220 --> 00:10:13.550
A small seed that reacted to your heart received energy from the subspace and grew larger.

00:10:14.490 --> 00:10:16.550
The Countess's heart...

00:10:17.530 --> 00:10:19.360
What a farce it is.

00:10:19.360 --> 00:10:24.830
To think that Tear's true identity is your heart, jealous of a rival in love...

00:10:28.270 --> 00:10:32.230
I have... destroyed the world...

00:10:44.520 --> 00:10:45.720
Yes...

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:50.150
At that time, I was summoned by her.

00:11:05.510 --> 00:11:06.940
How terrible...

00:11:16.690 --> 00:11:19.590
All of this began with you.

00:11:20.060 --> 00:11:24.760
So actually, won't everything be resolved if you die?

00:12:03.100 --> 00:12:04.430
Isamu...

00:12:04.940 --> 00:12:11.010
You have an obligation, an obligation to watch this farcical play through to the end.

00:12:12.140 --> 00:12:15.370
This is all a con game played by you and Tear.

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:18.150
You're going to keep us company until the end.

00:12:19.150 --> 00:12:20.520
Professor!

00:12:25.090 --> 00:12:29.420
Enkidu's wave has disappeared. Annihilate the lot of them!

00:12:35.300 --> 00:12:36.490
Protect the Professor!

00:13:02.560 --> 00:13:03.560
No!

00:13:03.560 --> 00:13:04.820
Reiko!

00:13:08.000 --> 00:13:11.400
We'll be putting an end to this con game too.

00:13:13.870 --> 00:13:15.340
Why?

00:13:18.080 --> 00:13:19.980
This, too, is the will of Tear.

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:28.180
Shall we?

00:13:35.460 --> 00:13:36.790
You bastard!

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:43.930
Collect Tear.

00:13:57.550 --> 00:14:00.350
I win, Granddad.

00:14:03.290 --> 00:14:04.550
No!

00:14:08.790 --> 00:14:09.890
I won't let you go.

00:14:26.640 --> 00:14:28.810
Mistook him for the old fart, huh?

00:14:37.290 --> 00:14:39.140
Toru!

00:14:47.530 --> 00:14:50.130
I'm sorry I couldn't protect you.

00:15:03.650 --> 00:15:04.910
Toru...

00:15:15.330 --> 00:15:16.950
I won't forgive that...

00:15:18.830 --> 00:15:20.590
I'll never forgive that!

00:15:28.840 --> 00:15:31.740
You don't need to feel sorrow any more.

00:15:32.180 --> 00:15:33.300
Fu!

00:15:38.480 --> 00:15:44.180
Madoka, I'm glad I got to meet you. Or what I mean is...

00:15:57.370 --> 00:16:00.700
This is what you call "emotion," isn't it?

00:16:01.570 --> 00:16:03.730
I thought I didn't have any!

00:16:11.420 --> 00:16:12.810
<i>Goodbye...</i>

00:16:21.190 --> 00:16:22.560
Fujisaki!

00:16:42.550 --> 00:16:43.710
Why?!

00:16:44.420 --> 00:16:45.640
Why?!

00:17:00.660 --> 00:17:01.890
Dad...

00:17:02.230 --> 00:17:04.170
Hundreds of millions of years from now...

00:17:04.240 --> 00:17:05.740
Kiyoko is dead.

00:17:05.740 --> 00:17:09.300
...from that shell, a new human race will be born.

00:17:10.010 --> 00:17:12.480
For that purpose, we will eliminate everything.

00:17:12.780 --> 00:17:14.440
Say something, Dad!

00:17:15.080 --> 00:17:17.010
Isn't she your own daughter?!

00:17:17.680 --> 00:17:21.620
All the matter on this Earth will become food for Tear...

00:17:22.650 --> 00:17:24.780
...within the Sheltering Sky.

00:17:25.490 --> 00:17:26.920
Dad...

00:17:34.400 --> 00:17:35.830
You son of a...

00:17:44.510 --> 00:17:45.740
Your sister...

00:17:48.480 --> 00:17:52.420
I loved her... this is the truth.

00:18:39.860 --> 00:18:44.300
This foolish three-act drama seems to have reached its closing curtain.

00:18:45.240 --> 00:18:47.470
It's about time we...

00:19:17.870 --> 00:19:19.530
Let's bring the curtain down.

00:19:27.540 --> 00:19:29.010
It's time.

00:19:29.710 --> 00:19:34.150
Yes, bring the Cleansing Flood.

00:20:43.920 --> 00:20:45.150
<i>Tatsuya...</i>
